{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_06",
  "title": "回聲飄蕩的大廳",
  "storyCode": "SS-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e073ce8dc13025e907174064d9d5da8d502a6fdb556e2425cf200f093f738303",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寒風在耳邊呼嘯而過。\n下墜，越來越快。\n然而即便如此，深淵仍不見底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我那些強人所難的要求，除了你還有其他鼓手能滿足嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是我見過的，最努力的鼓手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明……只需要做你自己就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g2_srcalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在各個組織間忙碌，卻找不到一個真正的落腳之處……這就是你想要的生活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本來不該承受這種痛苦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海鈴，和我一起離開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g4_islandharbor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定要找到你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "初華……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睦，這裡不是現實，我們現在應該……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "砰——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "急促的心跳，失控的呼吸，還有背脊上的冷汗。\n知覺再次回到了祥子體內，卻是以這種狼狽不堪的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很真實吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從不知道多高的地方，向地面墜落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有夢境破碎，被困在“無夢之境”又無法逃脫……感覺如何呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使那些夢都是美夢，它們也不該繼續下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "窺竊她們心裡最脆弱的部分，再將那些脆弱不斷地編排演繹……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不這麼認為哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你闖進她們的夢之前，她們幾乎就快忘記你，還有那個根本無足輕重的樂隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ave{@nbs}Mujica是我們的契約，她們把人生託付給我了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在乎它的只有你一個人吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是都親耳聽見了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們每一個人，全都拒絕了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不要，這裡的人愛著身為女演員的我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為了這些，拼盡了一切……結果你告訴我這些都是假的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說什麼鬼話，我不可能接受！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是我的夢境，只有我自己就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g2_srcalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼可能理解我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的生活就很好……這樣更適合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要誰來拯救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也沒有人能救我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g4_islandharbor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，小睦根本不需要祥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈……哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你所有狼狽、無助、可笑的時刻，我全都看在眼裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然之前你毀了我創造的夢境，不過這樣算下來，我們也算扯平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外還要謝謝你，在她們的夢裡一次又一次穿梭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫我證明——我創造的夢境就是完美無缺、無可挑剔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在那個傢伙也該承認，我才是夢城堡裡最有天賦的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個傢伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是在夢裡見過她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穿著貴族小姐般華麗的衣服，嘴裡說著一些老掉牙的客套話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待在她的身邊，簡直讓人坐立難安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲才是這裡的主人，你只是一個冒牌貨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她說過，再美好的夢，最後也應該醒來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子只覺得自己的聲帶被凝結，無法發出任何的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我終於知道你為什麼讓我這麼討厭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和她一樣，完全不聽別人的想法，嘴裡也永遠都是那些虛偽又空洞的說辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說什麼託付了人生，其實是不想自己被人捨棄吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看過你的人生，就只是一個落魄大小姐的不甘和掙扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的每一個舉動，無非就是在欺騙和說服自己，不想讓其他人覺得你落魄而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個人自負自傲、自私自利，簡直無可救藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的樂隊到底代表著什麼？哼，只是一群人用所謂的契約互相束縛，自娛自樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在她們都得到了幸福，當然就拋棄你了。豐川祥子，你又是孤身一人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你相信愛麗絲說的那些話，那好，我為你重新準備了一場好夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場夢天衣無縫，就算你知道它是假的，你也不會願意醒來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會和你的同伴們一樣，沉溺其中，無法自拔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想說話？那就讓你說最後一句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "惡魔般的少女在空中比劃了一個圖案，彷彿解開了什麼鎖鏈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鎖鏈又被狠狠地拉緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，你還是不說話的時候比較可愛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫菲絲一步步靠近掙扎的祥子，她伸出了右手，放在了祥子的臉頰上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虛偽的公主啊，在你剛才漫遊奇境時，我已經完全瞭解你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最渴望什麼，你最需要什麼，你最害怕什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，這次的夢，一定是完美的美夢。你會無比清醒，卻絕對不會想甦醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沉眠吧。高貴的、狡猾的、自私的，人偶少女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝你，有個好夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "匡噹，匡噹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，祥子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g1_transporter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是你說的那樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子失聲叫了出來，但她如今已不在城堡內，莫菲絲也消失得無影無蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好嗎？你的臉色很難看，是不是又做惡夢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又……回到自己的夢裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼傻話，你不是才剛醒過來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是睡昏頭了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲和貝娜也在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好……我好像還沒自我介紹過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們上車的時候，她好像已經睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和紅豆沒有遲到……夢發生改變了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你從剛才就一直在說一些奇怪的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們，現在要去維多利亞找安嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安是誰？愛麗絲你認識嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不認識，安是祥子小姐在小鎮的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸……？愛麗絲也不知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我和紅豆……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不就是因為剛好有派到你家附近的工作嗎？我就想說讓你也順便回家休息一下，順便看望家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直忙於工作，祥子你也很久沒有回家了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事，車怎麼突然停下來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會爆胎了吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……呼……呼……剛才差點撞上馱獸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好有驚無險，我們馬上重新出發！"
